10510","kind":"announcement","title":"DERELIKT Launches Date Reveal","summary":"Attention Administrator - DERELIKT Launches 13.11.2026We are happy to announce that the long wait is slowly coming to an end, as DERELIKT will launch on PC (Steam, GoG and EPIC) on the 13th of November this year. To give you a feel of what is to come, we have prepared a special trailer with some of the yet unseen retro CGI cutscenes.Console Launch DateFor those wanting to get their hit of nostalgia on their favourite sofa we say - do not worry! As DERELIKT will be coming to consoles as well, how","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T19:29:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114030114","verified_at":"2026-10-21T22:17:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3810510-1846018067931053","game_id":"steam-3810510","kind":"announcement","title":"DERELIKT Demo is now available","summary":"Demo Available - Contractors WantedFor those who have read our previous message this will come as no surprise, but to all those who have just joined us - we have just launched the very first public demo for DERELIKT.Von Neuman station beckons with all of its retro sci-fi glory and all of its lurking horrors. You will be able to enjoy 3 chapters of the full story albeit in a non-sequential order - we have to keep some secrets after all!For those who are returning after the playtest, first of all,","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T18:36:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067931053","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3810510-1845383656387310","game_id":"steam-3810510","kind":"announcement","title":"Attention Administrator: Beta Playtest ends Tomorrow","summary":"Beta Playtest ends TomorrowAttention all Playtesters, the Von Neuman station will remain open for one more day, so make sure to loot every corner and give the correct access code to the poor guy above the worm labs. We will also send one last round of invitations to give you one more shot to jump in and playtest the game.We would also like to thank all of the 5000+ playtesters who joined us in the dark corridors and ventilation shafts of the Von Neuman. Your overwhelmingly positive feedback was ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-02T18:15:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656387310","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3810510-1844115010492950","game_id":"steam-3810510","kind":"announcement","title":"BOOMSTOCK STARTS NOW. SO DOES DERELIKT PLAYTEST!","summary":"JOIN THE DERELIKT PLAYTEST TODAYTHE PARTY’S ON, AND WE DIDN’T COME EMPTY-HANDEDYes, you heard that right! To celebrate, we’ve just launched the public Steam Playtest, giving you access to a few selected sections of the game - from a routine visit to a research outpost orbiting Saturn to its exobiology sector and beyond, right where standard procedures end and improvisation becomes a matter of survival.Watch the newest Trailer!The briefing starts now!FIRST STOP: VON NEUMANN OUTPOSTYour contract s","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-17T18:17:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010492950","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3810510-1842212951303867","game_id":"steam-3810510","kind":"announcement","title":"INCOMING TRANSMISSION! - You Need to Go Back. Now!","summary":"NEW TOOLS, NEW PATHSYou know that door you couldn’t open a few levels ago?Keep it in mind.Exploration in DERELIKT isn’t always about pushing forward. Sometimes, getting new gear means realizing there’s a good reason to head back.You’ll run into damaged heavy doors that won’t budge, force fields blocking off entire sections, areas with radiation levels way too high to enter safely, and passages you simply don’t have the right equipment to deal with yet.So you move on.For now.Watch the enviro show","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-28T17:02:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951303867","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3810510-1839676055883213","game_id":"steam-3810510","kind":"announcement","title":"POLISH GAMEDEV TAKEOVER!","summary":"From Poland With Love is Live! 🇵🇱🎮Hey Hyperstrange folks!You know that legendary Polish hospitality where nobody is allowed to leave hungry, right?Well, we’re applying the same rule to your Steam library. From Poland With Love - the annual showcase hosted by Untold Tales - is back to set the table!That means a whole week of grabbing kick-ass games dirt cheap and catching early peeks at upcoming indie bangers.Naturally, we couldn’t just sit this one out. We’re bringing a selection of our released","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-29T17:48:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055883213","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3810510-1834602721185423","game_id":"steam-3810510","kind":"announcement","title":"DERELIKT JOINS THE HYPERSTRANGE FAMILY","summary":"Incoming transmission!Hyperstrange and Visuwyg, the creator of DERELIKT, are joining forces to bring this long-awaited PS1-styled sci-fi horror FPS to players in 2026.Set in orbit around Saturn, DERELIKT drops you into a place where something much older than nostalgia for classic sci-fi horror is waking up... and it is far more ominous.DERELIKT has been on many radars for a while now. Players have followed its development and kept the hype alive through a journey that has had more than a few twi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-03T17:09:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721185423","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3810510":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:46:21Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T00:46:20Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3810510":"2026-10-26T00:46:21Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3810510":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:46:20Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T00:46:20Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5242870":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:46:21Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T00:46:21Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-3810510","app_id":3810510,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:22Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"1320418a98380208200880dbfc37c0a2d556c07193762178adca4b822376401e","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"DERELIKT is a narrative retro FPS built for fans of claustrophobic PS1-era sci-fi horror.\r\n\r\n","publishers":[{"name":"Hyperstrange","creator_clan_account_id":38371631}],"developers":[{"name":"Visuwyg"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1794591000,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_full"},"traile